{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55841","headline":"添撰享太庙乐章 敬宗庙奏 · 张连","name":"添撰享太庙乐章 敬宗庙奏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大孝显庆，景运应时。\n德合天地，威戢蛮夷。\n神呈福祉，岁有经□。\n无私之礼，□□□□。\n（《大唐郊祀录》卷九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张连","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}